{"version": 2, "width": 112, "height": 34, "timestamp": 1787224870, "idle_time_limit": 2.0, "env": {"SHELL": "/usr/bin/zsh", "TERM": ""}, "title": "cdk-cicd-wrapper v3 — M3 multi-region deploy"}
[0.008495, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m 1. Where this recording came from\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.512887, "o", "\u001b[0;90m# Provenance first: branch, commit, clean tree.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.517558, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$ git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.522959, "o", "v3\r\n"]
[4.523142, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$ git rev-parse --short HEAD\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.528905, "o", "c5685fb\r\n"]
[5.529191, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$ git status --porcelain | head\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.54025, "o", "?? docs/proof/m3-multiregion.cast\r\n?? test/proof/demos/m3-multiregion.sh\r\n"]
[6.540826, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m 2. What M3 adds: deploy-time synth, multi-region, and a drift guard\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.540851, "o", "\u001b[1;36m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.044898, "o", "\u001b[0;90m# A user writes ONE cicd.config.ts. level1-app's 'dev' stage lists two regions:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.049049, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$ grep -A1 \"name: .dev.\" /home/gyalai/.workspace/src/cdk-cicd-wrapper/test/fixtures/level1-app/cicd.config.ts | sed \"s/process.env.*!/<from env>/\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.056017, "o", "    { name: 'dev', env: { account: <from env>, regions: ['us-west-2', 'us-west-1'] } },\r\n    {\r\n"]
[11.056435, "o", "\u001b[0;90m# The deploy model is: synth each stage x region at deploy time, check each synthesized\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[13.060723, "o", "\u001b[0;90m# assembly for drift (does its account/region match where we are deploying?), and only\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.065325, "o", "\u001b[0;90m# then deploy. An account mismatch aborts; a region mismatch only warns.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.069482, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m 3. Deploy one stage to two regions, from a single build\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[18.573948, "o", "\u001b[0;90m# One command. It synthesizes dev for both regions, drift-checks each, deploys both, and\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[20.578314, "o", "\u001b[0;90m# -- because this is the test harness -- asserts each region then tears them down through\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.582299, "o", "\u001b[0;90m# the teardown guard. The deploys are real; asciinema compresses the wait.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[24.586223, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$ bash test/proof/m3-verify.sh\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.602966, "o", "   generated run id r20260820112135  (export CDK_CICD_TEST_RUN_ID=r20260820112135 to reuse)\r\n\r\n== m3-verify (run id r20260820112135)  regions: us-west-2 + us-west-1\r\n"]
[26.670375, "o", "\r\n== leg 1: cdk-cicd deploy --stage dev (us-west-2 + us-west-1 from a single build)\r\n"]
